    "RandomCurves": {
      "Description": "<div><h2>Description</h2><div><p>This package loads the <a title=\"a Framework for the construction of random points of unirational moduli spaces\" href=\"#RandomObjects::RandomObjects\">RandomObjects</a>, <a title=\"Construction of random space curves of various kinds.\" href=\"#RandomSpaceCurves::RandomSpaceCurves\">RandomSpaceCurves</a>, <a title=\"random plane curves\" href=\"#RandomPlaneCurves::RandomPlaneCurves\">RandomPlaneCurves</a>, <a title=\"Construction of random curves of genus 14\" href=\"#RandomGenus14Curves::RandomGenus14Curves\">RandomGenus14Curves</a>, and <a title=\"Construction of canonical curves of genus less or equal to 14\" href=\"#RandomCanonicalCurves::RandomCanonicalCurves\">RandomCanonicalCurves</a> packages.</p></div></div>",
      "Headline": [
        "RandomCurves",
        " -- random curves"
      ],
      "Location": "../../../../Macaulay2/packages/RandomCurves.m2:39:0",
      "WaysToUse": "<div><div><div><h2>Authors</h2><ul><li><a href=\"http://www.math.uni-sb.de/ag/schreyer/\">Frank-Olaf Schreyer</a><span> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:schreyer%40math.uni-sb.de\">schreyer@math.uni-sb.de</a>></span></li><li><a href=\"http://www.crcg.de/wiki/User:Bothmer\">Hans-Christian Graf v. Bothmer</a><span> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:bothmer%40uni-math.gwdg.de\">bothmer@uni-math.gwdg.de</a>></span></li><li><a href=\"http://www.math.uni-sb.de/ag/schreyer/\">Florian Geiss</a><span> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:fg%40math.uni-sb.de\">fg@math.uni-sb.de</a>></span></li></ul></div><div><h2>Version</h2><p>This documentation describes version <b>0.6</b> of RandomCurves.</p></div></div><div class=\"waystouse\"><h2>For the programmer</h2><p>The object <a title=\"random curves\" href=\"#RandomCurves::RandomCurves\">RandomCurves</a> is <span>a <a title=\"the class of all packages\" href=\"#Macaulay2Doc::Package\">package</a></span>, defined in <a href=\"../../Macaulay2/RandomCurves.m2\">RandomCurves.m2</a>.</p></div><hr><div class=\"waystouse\"><p>The source of this document is in <a href=\"../../Macaulay2/RandomCurves.m2\">RandomCurves.m2:39:0</a>.</p></div></div>"
